{"html": "<div class=\"tpcard\"><div class=\"tph\">📌 注目開示トピックス（株価に効きやすい適時開示）</div><a class=\"tprow\" href=\"https://webapi.yanoshin.jp/rd.php?https://www.release.tdnet.info/inbs/140120261112575632.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tpbadge tpos\">自社株買い</span><span class=\"num\">11/12</span> 自己株式取得に係る事項の決定に関するお知らせ <span class=\"pdf\">PDF ›</span></a><div class=\"tpnote\">見出しの機械判定です。内容の良し悪し・織り込み済みかどうかは開示原文でご確認ください。採点には含めていません。</div></div><div class=\"nhead\">いまの指標の位置（主要11＋準主要12指標）</div><div class=\"mlegend\"><span style=\"background:#b9dcc0\">安心・標準</span><span style=\"background:#c9dcf3\">魅力あり（要確認）</span><span style=\"background:#f5e6b3\">注意</span><span style=\"background:#f2c4a8\">警戒</span><span style=\"background:#eeeae0\">中立</span></div><div class=\"meters\"><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">PER</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:16.7%; background:#c9dcf3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:16.7%; width:16.7%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:33.3%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:23.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">14.2倍</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">PBR</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:6.2%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:6.2%; width:12.5%; background:#c9dcf3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:18.8%; width:18.8%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:37.5%; width:62.5%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:9.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">0.72倍</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ROE</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:10.0%; width:6.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:16.7%